        "item_gap_mobile": 30,
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/model_mockups__48_7e081895-0b5a-4d32-bdfc-850f7d4686cb.png",
        "link": "",
        "layout": "right",
        "image_column_size": "6",
        "hover_effect": true,
        "title": "",
        "sub_title": "About Us",
        "text": "<p><strong>At Noir Nectar Greeting Cards and Heirlooms, we believe words are sacred—and when paired with art, they become a ministry of beauty, memory, and belonging.</strong></p><p><strong>Our mission is to uplift and celebrate Black women with intention, reverence, and truth—without apology. We create more than cards; we create keepsakes that speak to the soul, honor legacy, and remind each Queen of her divine worth.</strong></p><p><strong>Whether it’s a whispered love note, a powerful birthday blessing, or a sacred message of gratitude, each card is crafted to express what words alone often cannot. Every detail—from design to language—is chosen to reflect the richness, resilience, and radiant spirit of Black womanhood.</strong></p><p><strong>This mission is deeply personal to me.<br/>As a Black woman, I know what it means to fight for your worth in a world that often overlooks you. I know the quiet strength it takes to keep going, the beauty in healing, and the power of finally realizing—you are enough. Noir Nectar was born from that realization. It is my love letter to us. To every Queen who deserves to be honored, celebrated, and seen.</strong></p><p><strong>We don’t just write cards.<br/>We honor stories.<br/>We crown moments.<br/>We speak light—Queen to Queen.</strong></p>",
        "text_size": "medium",
        "content_alignment": "center",
        "button_label": "Read More About Us",
        "button_link": "shopify://pages/about-us",
        "button_style": "m-button--primary",
        "button_size": "",
        "padding_top": 50,
        "padding_bottom": 50,
        "custom_class": "",
        "animations": "inherit"
      }
    },
