    "testimonials_J3tnKL": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_biWWed": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "description": "<p>Noir Nectar cards are simply beautiful! Every card I’ve sent has brought tears of joy to my friends and family. The designs are stunning, and the messages are heartfelt. I love how they celebrate Black women with such grace and elegance.\"</p>",
            "footer": "<p>Samantha L.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Gemini_Generated_Image_ms4mqoms4mqoms4m.png",
            "image_text": "",
            "image_link": "",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_i7whcg": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "description": "<p>I have ordered from many card companies but Noir Nectar is in a class by itself. Their designs are fresh but timeless, the fonts and color palette feel regal, and the emotional depth is unmatched. I received so many compliments when I used their cards for my daughter’s first birthday invitations. More than just stationery, they are heirlooms.</p>",
            "footer": "<p>Tamika K</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/classic-dad-hat-black-right-side-69d090cd7c40a.jpg",
            "image_text": "",
            "image_link": "",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_fQHXJr": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "description": "<p>I rarely find greeting cards that reflect me, my experiences, or my heritage. Noir Nectar’s cards do just that. From the art to the words, they celebrate Black womanhood in such a holy and beautiful way. When I sent one to my grandmother, she cried and said she felt seen. I will never go back to generic cards again.</p>",
            "footer": "<p>Simone L.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Necklace-4.jpg",
            "image_text": "",
            "image_link": "",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_Aa9MLL": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "description": "<p>Finding Noir Nectar was like discovering a hidden gem. The quality of the cards is unmatched, and the attention to detail is incredible. I especially appreciate the representation and empowerment of Black women in their designs. These cards are more than just stationery; they are keepsakes</p>",
            "footer": "<p>Angela M.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/2c5aaf1c-89a2-4c79-8fc2-079bffbbd37f_1024.png",
            "image_text": "",
            "image_link": "",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_AEVUgU": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "description": "<p>I’ve never been so moved by a greeting card before. Noir Nectar’s cards resonate deeply with me and those I send them to. They perfectly capture the emotions I want to convey, and their dedication to celebrating Black women is truly inspiring.</p>",
            "footer": "<p>Emily R.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/classic-dad-hat-black-front-69d090cd7bbdd.jpg",
            "image_text": "",
            "image_link": "",
            "product": "emerald-whister-cuff-bracelet"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_HqLBm8": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "description": "<p>Every Noir Nectar card I’ve purchased has been a work of art. The combination of sophisticated design and meaningful messages makes each card special. I’m proud to support a company that uplifts and honors Black women in such a beautiful way.</p>",
            "footer": "<p>Michael D.</p>",
            "image_text": "",
            "image_link": "",
            "product": ""
          }
        }
      },
